，官至南郡太守、尚書。玄子尚，孫皓時為侍郎，以言語辯捷見知，擢為侍中、中書令。皓使尚鼓琴，尚對曰：「素不能。」敕使學之。後宴言次說琴之精妙，尚因道「晉平公使師曠作清角，曠言吾君德薄，不足以聽之。」皓意謂尚以斯喻己，不悅。後積他事下獄，皆追此為詰，送建安作船。久之，又就加誅。初，紘同郡秦松字文表，陳端字子正，並與紘見待於孫策，參與謀謨。各早卒。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong:line018:m0156"}],"interpretation_note":"本來源所記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong:line018:m0156","start":156,"end":158,"surface":"秦松","kind":"person","person_id":"2fy_jac_mju","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong:line018","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong:line018:m0159","start":159,"end":161,"surface":"文表","kind":"person","person_id":"2fy_jac_mju","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong:line018","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-luji:line037:m0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"秦松","kind":"person","person_id":"2fy_jac_mju","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-luji:line037","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-luji"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong:line018","text":"　　紘著詩賦銘誄十餘篇。子玄，官至南郡太守、尚書。玄子尚，孫皓時為侍郎，以言語辯捷見知，擢為侍中、中書令。皓使尚鼓琴，尚對曰：「素不能。」敕使學之。後宴言次說琴之精妙，尚因道「晉平公使師曠作清角，曠言吾君德薄，不足以聽之。」皓意謂尚以斯喻己，不悅。後積他事下獄，皆追此為詰，送建安作船。久之，又就加誅。初，紘同郡秦松字文表，陳端字子正，並與紘見待於孫策，參與謀謨。各早卒。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong:line018:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"紘","kind":"person","person_id":"6bz_2xv_ow3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-zhanghong:line018:m0013","start":1